  message: "Fix decided after dogfooding: 'hypergumbo explain scan_library_patterns -x' confirmed Called by: (none), and 'hypergumbo explain annotate_dataflow -x' showed 10 analyzers integrated. Wired scan_library_patterns into annotate_dataflow as a per-language fallback after the AST walk. AST positional rules retain precedence. Validation: alertmanager calls edges with access_mode='write' went 0 → 274; read 4520 → 4688. PR pending. Expected to clear prometheus LOW_DATAFLOW_SLICE_RATIO WARN."  # 4dda
